{"ID":"20240118144958-i8mge33","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118144958-i8mge33","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118144958-i8mge33\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118144958-jf1icmb\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122165918-dobyg5p\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122165918-dobyg5p\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:186,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:199\u0026#125;","title":"368补11鸡矢白——（鸡矢白散）","type":"doc","updated":"20240204162536"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118144958-jf1icmb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118144958-jf1icmb","updated":"20240122165855"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】处处有之。为鸡食砂岩后排出之大便中，色白者。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122165856-jodfo0i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122165856-jodfo0i"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味苦，性微寒，无毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122165858-tpe0pxk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122165858-tpe0pxk"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】主行水消积，治鼓胀，疗转筋入腹，破石淋，利二便，下气破血，治伤寒寒热中风贼风风痹白虎风，贴风痛头痛，止遗溺，灭瘢痕，小儿客忤惊啼，解金银毒，酒服疗乳妒乳痈乳头破裂，外敷秃疮耳疮瘰疬。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122165901-ct58ioh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122165901-ct58ioh"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【素问】治臌胀。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122165902-jxn80ya","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122165902-jxn80ya"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通一钱至三钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122165904-mcjwf3k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122165904-mcjwf3k"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】酒服最佳。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122165905-rxfdwrk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122165905-rxfdwrk"}},{"ID":"20240122165905-fisyuo7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122165905-fisyuo7"}},{"ID":"20240122165905-mr0h6ph","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122165905-mr0h6ph","updated":"20240204162445"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第十一呢鸡矢白，这个鸡矢白呢方子在《黄帝内经》里面有介绍，就是我们讲鸡呢山鸡啊放山鸡，吃的那个砂岩石灰岩以后排出来的大便，颜色白的我们把它收起来，这个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"主行水消积专门治鼓胀"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这个不是说拿起来就给他吃下去啊，不是，这个鸡矢白拿出来炮炙过炙过烤过烤过以后味道没有啦，跟酒撒酒上去混在一起吃下去才有效，不是光喝，这个呢它鸡矢白能解金银毒，酒服疗乳房的癌啊，乳房硬块啊，乳房化脓啊，乳头破裂啊，都可以使用这个鸡矢白，那"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"解金银毒"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，我们如果说有金中毒或者银中毒这种东西，发生的时候五金的中毒，铜啊金银铜铁锡，你不要去记鸡矢白解金银毒那铜毒啊什么东西你不要。"}]},{"ID":"20240122165918-dobyg5p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122165918-dobyg5p","updated":"20240204162536"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（记住）"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"硫磺解五金毒"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以我们真的五金中毒的时候我们使用硫磺一律用硫磺，硫磺解毒一下统统清出来，这个是用硫磺来解金属的毒最好速度最快，所以有金属中毒的时候大家记得用石硫磺，不要忘了我们介绍本草经的时候前面有土硫磺，市面上有土硫磺跟石硫磺，土硫磺不入药不入内服的药啊，只入外敷的伤科才用的，【素问】呢你看22页，素问讲这个鸡矢白记录就是腹胀肚子胀，所以诸位现在学到了，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"一味药来治疗腹胀就是鸡矢白"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，那普通一钱到三钱酒服用酒来吞服最好。"}]}]}